<section class="sec sec--alt" id="work">
  <div class="wrap prof-grid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display" data-en="What it takes off the desk" data-ar="ما يرفعه عن مكتبك">What it takes off the desk</h2>
      <ol class="proc" style="margin-top:32px">
        <li><div><b data-en="Bookings" data-ar="الحجوزات">Bookings</b><span data-en="Patients book on WhatsApp or the web, in their language, at any hour." data-ar="يحجز المرضى عبر واتساب أو الموقع، بلغتهم، في أي ساعة.">Patients book on WhatsApp or the web, in their language, at any hour.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Reminders and no-shows" data-ar="التذكيرات والغياب">Reminders and no-shows</b><span data-en="A reminder the day before. A missed slot is offered again the same day." data-ar="تذكير قبل يوم. والموعد الفائت يُعرض مجدداً في اليوم نفسه.">A reminder the day before. A missed slot is offered again the same day.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Intake forms" data-ar="نماذج الاستقبال">Intake forms</b><span data-en="History and consent forms filled before the patient arrives." data-ar="نماذج التاريخ المرضي والموافقة تُملأ قبل وصول المريض.">History and consent forms filled before the patient arrives.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Insurance paperwork" data-ar="أوراق التأمين">Insurance paperwork</b><span data-en="Pre-approval requests prepared and chased until there is an answer." data-ar="طلبات الموافقة المسبقة تُعدّ وتُتابع حتى يصل رد.">Pre-approval requests prepared and chased until there is an answer.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Reviews" data-ar="التقييمات">Reviews</b><span data-en="Happy patients are asked for a review. Unhappy ones reach a person." data-ar="يُطلب من المرضى الراضين تقييم. وغير الراضين يصلون إلى إنسان.">Happy patients are asked for a review. Unhappy ones reach a person.</span></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="stays" data-en="What stays with the clinic: diagnosis, treatment and every medical decision." data-ar="ما يبقى للعيادة: التشخيص والعلاج وكل قرار طبي.">What stays with the clinic: diagnosis, treatment and every medical decision.</p>
    </div>
    <article class="example">
      <span class="meta" data-en="Example · a 4-doctor dental clinic" data-ar="مثال · عيادة أسنان بأربعة أطباء">Example · a 4-doctor dental clinic</span>
      <h3 data-en="A cancelled 10:00 slot filled by 10:20." data-ar="موعد 10:00 أُلغي ثم امتلأ قبل 10:20.">A cancelled 10:00 slot filled by 10:20.</h3>
      <ol>
          <li><time>08:30</time><span data-en="A patient cancels the 10:00 cleaning by WhatsApp." data-ar="مريض يلغي موعد التنظيف الساعة 10:00 عبر واتساب.">A patient cancels the 10:00 cleaning by WhatsApp.</span></li>
          <li><time>08:31</time><span data-en="The agent offers the slot to 5 patients on the waiting list." data-ar="يعرض الوكيل الموعد على 5 مرضى في قائمة الانتظار.">The agent offers the slot to 5 patients on the waiting list.</span></li>
          <li><time>08:44</time><span data-en="One accepts. Their intake form is sent and filled." data-ar="يقبل أحدهم. ويُرسل له نموذج الاستقبال فيملؤه.">One accepts. Their intake form is sent and filled.</span></li>
          <li><time>10:00</time><span data-en="The chair is full. The front desk did nothing." data-ar="الكرسي ممتلئ. ولم يفعل الاستقبال شيئاً.">The chair is full. The front desk did nothing.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="after" data-en="The agent never gives medical advice. Symptoms and questions go to the clinic team." data-ar="لا يقدّم الوكيل نصيحة طبية أبداً. الأعراض والأسئلة تذهب إلى فريق العيادة.">The agent never gives medical advice. Symptoms and questions go to the clinic team.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
